## Our Inspiration

House of Motubatsi draws inspiration from Basotho culture, traditional clothing, the Basotho blanket and the iconic Mokorotlo. These cultural elements are incorporated into a modern luxury aesthetic.

## Our Values

- Heritage

- Quality

- Elegance

- Creativity

- Cultural Identity

- Confidence

